dspan. No loads are supplied. Evaluate self-weight and added weight using g=9.81, tapered-beam bending/deflection, persisted stiffness and failure stress, actual defects and moisture. Record applied load, span, deflection, damage and uncertainty. Passing proves only that tested configuration and condition; it does not authorize longer spans or untested batches. Failed material retains permanent deformation or fractures into conserved fragments; test weights survive unless separately damaged. Shelter tests/builds consume these measured intervals and configuration-specific records, retain their existing factor-two proof and material requirements, and cannot bypass missing roofing or lash geometry.\\nPersistent contract: store operation owner, exact specimen/load IDs, layout, reserved quantities, paid stages, remaining stages and component state. Reserve without duplicating inventory mass; test loads remain actor-owned escrow. Missing energy/access pauses without free progress. Resume validates the same surviving materials and executes only unpaid remaining stages; completion occurs once. Explicit cancellation, incompatible movement/action or death stops active work, releases surviving uninstalled escrow exactly once at its actual location, preserves damage and paid history, and never refunds effort or resurrects consumed material. Shared source locks and geometry prevent double allocation and overlapping layouts. Inspection and diagnostics do not require a new active project slot; full logs remain in retained records without automatic archival. Implementation, learning and execution are separate and advance no time during review/development.\",\"experienceReview\":\"Use the existing grounded-understanding source, not a new alias or mastery reward. Declare metrology-measured, metrology-load-tested, metrology-progress and metrology-stopped events, plus qualified information-confirmed on this interface. Qualification requires the acting participant to complete paid measurement or testing that establishes previously unknown observed dimensions, load response or a genuine applicability limit; merely assigning geometry, reading diagnostics, requesting or learning does not qualify. Bind this interface as an alternative trigger: transient amount 0.8, source cap 1, duration 8 rounds, refresh repetition, 12-round cooldown. Maintained understanding gains 0.035 on qualifying events under the same cooldown, saturates at the shared source cap 1 and decays 0.0015 per round without qualifying participation. Known repeated readings do not provide new-information feedback. This measures bounded satisfaction from resolving a real uncertainty, separately from temporary pleasure; no additional pleasure or physical-comfort award is warranted by handling or measuring a branch. Later beneficial sheltered rest remains governed by existing actual-exposure and refuge rules.\",\"visualReview\":\"Render the actual tapered specimen, ground supports, collision footprint, load placement and observable bending or fracture in shared geometry. Measurement overlays show sampled endpoints, units, uncertainty intervals and paid-stage progress, never a suitability badge based on resource name. Replay metrology-measured and metrology-load-tested with persistent specimen IDs, geometry-law version, measured intervals, actual loads, configuration, energy paid, damage, escrow disposition and remaining work; bind progress/stopped events to matching operation IDs. Geometry introduced by migration is visibly distinguished from actor-measured evidence. A measurement produces no roof, shade or shelter-completion animation.\",\"learning\":2}]}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

